  "setup.cloud.error.store_has_main_till": {
    "explanation": "Inline error in the setup wizard (Join an existing shop, Main till): the shop on my.universaltill.com already has a live main till. Says how to replace it (my. Tills page, 'Replace this till', a new code) or join as another till. 'Additional till' and 'Satellite' are the role choices above the field; keep them as the till's own labels for those roles.\n\nPlaceholders:\n- %[1]s: the existing main till's name\n- %[2]s: when it was last seen (YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM UTC)",
